Rāma summons ministers brothers and eight brāhmaṇas --- Rāma recounts wailing brāhmaṇa to shining sages --- Nārada promises remedy after hearing cause --- Nārada recalls deathless Kr̥ta of brāhmaṇa ascetics --- Nārada tells Trētā foundation of four varṇas --- Nārada tells Dvāpara growth of untruth and tapas --- Nārada names śūdra ascetic on realm border --- Nārada bids Rāma seek wrong and save boy